i ya kifahari.","Tuzo ni ya kifahari sana.","Yeye ni profesa maarufu.","Jarida ni la kifahari.","Yeye ni mtafiti maarufu.","Klabu ni ya kifahari sana."]},{"id":"ielts-v-001180","s":["Yeye ni mwanasayansi mashuhuri.","Aliandika kuhusu wasomi mashuhuri.","Daktari mashuhuri aliongea.","Yeye ni maarufu katika uwanja wake.","Yeye ni mwanahistoria mashuhuri.","Profesa huyo mashuhuri alistaafu.","Yeye ni daktari bingwa wa upasuaji.","Yeye ni mwandishi mashuhuri.","Msanii mashuhuri alikufa.","Yeye ni hakimu mashuhuri."]},{"id":"ielts-v-001181","s":["Yeye ni mtu mashuhuri.","Yeye ni wakili maarufu.","Jengo maarufu ni refu.","Aliandika kuhusu viongozi mashuhuri.","Yeye ni mwanaharakati maarufu.","Kipengele maarufu ni mnara.","Yeye ni mkosoaji maarufu.","Yeye ni daktari maarufu.","Jukumu maarufu linamfaa.","Ni mfanyabiashara maarufu."]},{"id":"ielts-v-001182","s":["Mwandishi haeleweki sana.","Alipata kitabu kisichojulikana.","Aliandika juu ya washairi wasiojulikana.","Kijiji hakijafahamika.","Ni msanii asiyejulikana.","Marejeleo hayaeleweki.","Anasoma lugha zisizoeleweka.","Bendi haijafahamika.","Ni msomi asiyeeleweka.","Ukweli haujulikani."]},{"id":"ielts-v-001183","s":["Yeye ni mpishi mashuhuri.","Anasifika kwa utafiti wake.","Profesa mashuhuri alifundisha.","Aliandika kuhusu wasanii mashuhuri.","Yeye ni daktari wa upasuaji maarufu.","Hoteli maarufu imejaa.","Anasifika kwa wema wake.","Mwandishi mashuhuri alitia saini vitabu.","Anajulikana duniani kote.","Mwanasayansi mashuhuri alishinda tuzo."]},{"id":"ielts-v-001184","s":["Filamu hiyo inasifiwa.","Yeye ni mkurugenzi anayesifiwa.","Aliandika riwaya iliyosifiwa.","Tamthilia hiyo maarufu ilifunguliwa jana usiku.","Anasifiwa kwa kazi yake.","Albamu inayosifiwa ni maarufu sana.","Yeye ni mwigizaji anayejulikana.","Mgahawa unaojulikana ni wa gharama kubwa.","Ni mwandishi anayesifiwa.","Onyesho la sifa liliisha."]},{"id":"ielts-v-001185","s":["Chakula kilikuwa cha wastani.","Alitoa utendaji wa wastani.","Aliandika juu ya matokeo 